        (2 * (2 * (c * (D.R.rS : ℝ) ^ 2)) + 2 * (c * (D.R.rS : ℝ) ^ 2) + 6 * ((D.R.rS : ℝ) + 1) ^ 2) ≤
      C * ((2 * D.R.rS + 2 : ℕ) : ℝ) ^ 2 * D.R.f * (C * ((2 * D.R.rS + 2 : ℕ) : ℝ) ^ 3)) :
    corankOneBound D large₂ u u' c C2 Ch δ C0 ≤ oneB D large₂ C * rDD D u' := by
